(5907891, 860142, 11854, '<td valign="top">I seriously considered taking a ride to the shore to get this picture, but laziness won out. LOL! Great processing!</td>', 'I seriously considered taking a ride to the shore to get this picture, but laziness won out. LOL! Great processing!', '2010-03-17 08:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
