(5907914, 860393, 43774, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty freaky! Fits the challenge well but your photo appears underexposed.....it''s very dark and dull.</td>', 'That''s pretty freaky! Fits the challenge well but your photo appears underexposed.....it''s very dark and dull.', '2010-03-17 08:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
