(5915356, 860453, 99263, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments and votes. I am really stoked that I have at last managed to get a ribbon and the coveted Blue at that. When this challenge started I didn''t in my wildest dreams think that would happen. <br/>Edited: spelling error.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-03-24 03:27:09.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments and votes. I am really stoked that I have at last managed to get a ribbon and the coveted Blue at that. When this challenge started I didn''t in my wildest dreams think that would happen. Edited: spelling error.', '2010-03-24 02:40:50.000000', '2010-03-24 03:27:09.000000', 0),
