(5915402, 860453, 18655, '<td valign="top">Congrats with a very well deserved blue! I like this a lot. My choice for blue as well :)</td>', 'Congrats with a very well deserved blue! I like this a lot. My choice for blue as well :)', '2010-03-24 03:24:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915403, 861049, 28742, '<td valign="top">Decent score, excellent image. I had hoped to get an EMP shot entered, but I didn''t make it downtown til a few days after the challenge. It''s hard to get a clean shot without people or branches and with enough of the building to make it interesting. Cheers, Frank.</td>', 'Decent score, excellent image. I had hoped to get an EMP shot entered, but I didn''t make it downtown til a few days after the challenge. It''s hard to get a clean shot without people or branches and with enough of the building to make it interesting. Cheers, Frank.', '2010-03-24 03:24:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915406, 861325, 5585, '<td valign="top">Way to go Raj...</td>', 'Way to go Raj...', '2010-03-24 03:48:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915419, 860453, 64844, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning picture of this interesting building! Congratulations on a well deserved Blue!<br/></td>', 'This is a stunning picture of this interesting building! Congratulations on a well deserved Blue!', '2010-03-24 04:04:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915425, 860453, 106109, '<td valign="top">Outstanding, Jan!!!  I am so happy for you. This is such a cool photo and nicely shot. Bravo to a well deserved win.  --Rick</td>', 'Outstanding, Jan!!!  I am so happy for you. This is such a cool photo and nicely shot. Bravo to a well deserved win.  --Rick', '2010-03-24 04:11:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915462, 861244, 28742, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on 10th, Janine!</td>', 'Congratulations on 10th, Janine!', '2010-03-24 04:59:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915482, 860322, 37845, '<td valign="top">Good finish overall, and great score.</td>', 'Good finish overall, and great score.', '2010-03-24 06:38:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915486, 861325, 64844, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the yellow ribbon! What an interesting building! Looks as if made of cork!</td>', 'Congratulations on the yellow ribbon! What an interesting building! Looks as if made of cork!', '2010-03-24 06:46:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915494, 860939, 87252, '<td valign="top">Good shot Paul - nice to see an original view of this place.</td>', 'Good shot Paul - nice to see an original view of this place.', '2010-03-24 06:57:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915495, 860453, 93872, '<td valign="top">Congrats to you as well!  (And cheers to the first ribbon for both of us!)  Outstanding image, well-deserved.</td>', 'Congrats to you as well!  (And cheers to the first ribbon for both of us!)  Outstanding image, well-deserved.', '2010-03-24 06:57:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915497, 861325, 93872, '<td valign="top">Raj -- thanks for the kind comments and Favorite... congrats to you as well!  Awesome images, love the tones...</td>', 'Raj -- thanks for the kind comments and Favorite... congrats to you as well!  Awesome images, love the tones...', '2010-03-24 07:00:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915499, 861117, 87252, '<td valign="top">Ooo this is really nice, great lines and I like how each pane of glass has it''s own little world reflected in it.</td>', 'Ooo this is really nice, great lines and I like how each pane of glass has it''s own little world reflected in it.', '2010-03-24 07:02:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915512, 861348, 113278, '<td valign="top">I loved this shot and this was one of my 10''s. and congrats on the posthumous blue.</td>', 'I loved this shot and this was one of my 10''s. and congrats on the posthumous blue.', '2010-03-24 07:18:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915518, 860516, 20608, '<td valign="top">Hey, you still around man</td>', 'Hey, you still around man', '2010-03-24 07:24:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915519, 861043, 20608, '<td valign="top">Hey Duds, good to see ya.</td>', 'Hey Duds, good to see ya.', '2010-03-24 07:24:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915535, 861244, 106349, '<td valign="top">That''s so funny! When I saw this challenge that''s the exact building that came to mind. Good job!</td>', 'That''s so funny! When I saw this challenge that''s the exact building that came to mind. Good job!', '2010-03-24 07:46:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915546, 860979, 82112, '<td valign="top">Karen,<br/> <br/>Anyone can snap a photo of a strange building, but you''ve taken the common, and made it uncommon to fit the challenge. I love what you''ve done with this. The presence of the car and no parking sign really helps to sell the effect. Nice Job!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-03-24 07:58:31.</i></td>', 'Karen, Anyone can snap a photo of a strange building, but you''ve taken the common, and made it uncommon to fit the challenge. I love what you''ve done with this. The presence of the car and no parking sign really helps to sell the effect. Nice Job!', '2010-03-24 07:56:32.000000', '2010-03-24 07:58:31.000000', 0),
(5915569, 860287, 10785, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by EL-ROI:</b></div><hr/><i> This seriouly makes my stomach queasy due to dizziness from looking at it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I just realized that this could have been taken to be a negative comment. I really meant that it was a good photo because I felt like I was right there looking down and getting dizzy from it. Sorry if I didn''t make myself clear. (I really did get dizzy!)</td>', 'Originally posted by EL-ROI: This seriouly makes my stomach queasy due to dizziness from looking at it.   I just realized that this could have been taken to be a negative comment. I really meant that it was a good photo because I felt like I was right there looking down and getting dizzy from it. Sorry if I didn''t make myself clear. (I really did get dizzy!)', '2010-03-24 08:13:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915587, 860453, 113075, '<td valign="top">Congrats, beautiful work!</td>', 'Congrats, beautiful work!', '2010-03-24 08:21:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915608, 861182, 30049, '<td valign="top">Darn, I was hoping to read a story about this building.  :-(  This was one of my top picks for the challenge.  I''m starting to bump into more and more of your photos at the top of my personal rankings.  :-)<br/> <br/>I guess there''s not been much for ground movement in 250 years at this location, eh?  That building looks precariously balanced!<br/> <br/>Congrats on a Top Ten finish.</td>', 'Darn, I was hoping to read a story about this building.  :-(  This was one of my top picks for the challenge.  I''m starting to bump into more and more of your photos at the top of my personal rankings.  :-) I guess there''s not been much for ground movement in 250 years at this location, eh?  That building looks precariously balanced! Congrats on a Top Ten finish.', '2010-03-24 08:31:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915640, 861187, 81530, '<td valign="top">Great shot. 9 from me.</td>', 'Great shot. 9 from me.', '2010-03-24 08:58:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915641, 861325, 81530, '<td valign="top">Great year so far Raj. Keep it up!</td>', 'Great year so far Raj. Keep it up!', '2010-03-24 08:59:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915658, 860979, 64844, '<td valign="top">What a great way to make ''normal'' look ''bizarre''! I was totally fooled by the tilted crop and after seeing the outtakes I understand how it worked!</td>', 'What a great way to make ''normal'' look ''bizarre''! I was totally fooled by the tilted crop and after seeing the outtakes I understand how it worked!', '2010-03-24 09:27:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915673, 861155, 64844, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. Looking at your outtakes it is the best choice! Even though I cannot exactly tell what kind of a building this is, I like the pole going up into Nirvana. The crooked half round rail and strings in the background add the unconventional design - what is it by the way?</td>', 'I really like this one. Looking at your outtakes it is the best choice! Even though I cannot exactly tell what kind of a building this is, I like the pole going up into Nirvana. The crooked half round rail and strings in the background add the unconventional design - what is it by the way?', '2010-03-24 09:34:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915674, 861269, 102278, '<td valign="top">Very interesting! Great job. Didn''t have a chance to view or vote so going through now.</td>', 'Very interesting! Great job. Didn''t have a chance to view or vote so going through now.', '2010-03-24 09:34:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915727, 860170, 114259, '<td valign="top">Wow. I am only here to learn. I never thought that I would get this high of a rating.<br/> <br/>Thank you all for your feedback.</td>', 'Wow. I am only here to learn. I never thought that I would get this high of a rating. Thank you all for your feedback.', '2010-03-24 10:33:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915736, 861164, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nicer finish, Tate.  Your processing worked wonders on this building.</td>', 'Nicer finish, Tate.  Your processing worked wonders on this building.', '2010-03-24 10:41:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915767, 860170, 114259, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GeneralE:</b></div><hr/><i> Why do I look at this picture and immediately thnk "Beatles" ...? :-)<br/> <br/>Excellent composition and tonal range -- feels like being there and seeing it live. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I was going to name this picture "I am the eggman"</td>', 'Originally posted by GeneralE: Why do I look at this picture and immediately thnk "Beatles" ...? :-) Excellent composition and tonal range -- feels like being there and seeing it live.   I was going to name this picture "I am the eggman"', '2010-03-24 11:03:48.000000', NULL, 0),
