(5916925, 860641, 113591, '<td valign="top">These are real, live, and (relitavely) dangerous wasps. They are alive and well, half a meter to the left of my home''s main entrance. Normally, my wife asks me to remove the nests, but she doesn''t know about this one yet. The other problem is that there is a fish pond underneath, so I had to balance on the side of the pond, push the camera slowly towards the nest, so as not to anger anything or anybody, steady the camera and press the trigger.</td>', 'These are real, live, and (relitavely) dangerous wasps. They are alive and well, half a meter to the left of my home''s main entrance. Normally, my wife asks me to remove the nests, but she doesn''t know about this one yet. The other problem is that there is a fish pond underneath, so I had to balance on the side of the pond, push the camera slowly towards the nest, so as not to anger anything or anybody, steady the camera and press the trigger.', '2010-03-25 04:39:47.000000', NULL, 0),
